On Error Goto E
M=Mubase
Print #1,"clock";Leek(M+12);Deek(M+118);Deek(M+110);Deek(M+142);Deek(M+144)
For V=0 To 3 : Print #1,Deek(M+20+V*2);Deek(M+30+V*20+2); : Next V : Print #1,""
Volume 30 : Volume 5,12 : Mvolume 40
For V=0 To 3 : Print #1,Deek(M+30+V*20+2); : Next V : Print #1,Deek(M+142)
Sam Bank 7 : Print #1,"bank";Deek(M+110)
Wave 1 To 15 : Noise To 3
For V=0 To 3 : Print #1,Deek(M+20+V*2); : Next V : Print #1,""
A$="" : For I=0 To 255 : A$=A$+Chr$((I*37+11) mod 256) : Next I
Set Wave 2,A$ : Set Wave 3,String$("A",256)
Set Envel 2,1 To 10,40 : Set Envel 2,0 To 3,63
W=Leek(Leek(M+16)) : While W : Print #1,"wave";Deek(W+4); : S=0 : For I=0 To 509 : S=S+Peek(W+70+I)*(I mod 13+1) : Next I : Print #1,S; : For I=0 To 11 : Print #1,Deek(W+6+I*2); : Next I : Print #1,"" : W=Leek(W) : Wend
Wave 2 To 1 : Print #1,Deek(M+20)
Del Wave 2
W=Leek(M+16) : While W : Print #1,"after";Deek(W+4) : W=Leek(W) : Wend
For V=0 To 3 : Print #1,Deek(M+20+V*2); : Next V : Print #1,""
Wave 9 To 1
Del Wave 1
Del Wave 0
Set Wave 4,"short"
Set Envel 3,7 To 1,1
Set Envel 3,0 To 0,1
Sam Bank 0
Sam Bank 17
Tempo 200
Print #1,Vumeter(5)
Music 1
Sam Play 1
Load "AMOSPRO:Examples/Music/Music.abk"
Music 1 : Print #1,"mu";Deek(M+140);Leek(M+4)-M;Leek(M+128)-Start(3);Leek(M+132)-Start(3);Leek(M+136)-Start(3)
Tempo 50 : Print #1,Deek(M+166+162)
Voice %0011 : Print #1,Deek(M+144)
Music 2 : Music 3 : Music 1 : Print #1,Deek(M+140);Leek(M+4)-M
Music Stop : Music Off : Print #1,Deek(M+140);Leek(M+4)
Music 99
Wait Vbl : Music 1 : Wait 40 : T=M+166
For V=0 To 3 : Print #1,Deek(T+V*40+24);Deek(T+V*40+20);Leek(T+V*40)-Start(3);Deek(T+V*40+28);Deek(T+V*40+34) : Next V
Print #1,Deek(T+160);Deek(T+162);Peek(M);Peek(M+1);Peek(M+2);Peek(M+3)
Wait 25 : For V=0 To 3 : Print #1,Deek(T+V*40+24);Deek(T+V*40+20);Leek(T+V*40)-Start(3) : Next V
Music Off
Load "AMOSPRO:Examples/Samples/Instruments.abk",7
Sam Play 1 : Wait 5 : Sam Play 2,2,8000 : Wait 5 : Sam Stop
Sam Play 1,99
Sam Play 3,1,400
Sam Loop On : Sam Play 2 : Wait 3 : Sam Loop Off : Sam Stop
Sample 2 To 2 : Print #1,Deek(M+22)
Play 2,40,0 : Play 1,30,2 : Play Off : Play 1,200,0
Bell : Bell 50 : Boom : Shoot : Wait 10
Play 30,0 : Wait 5 : Play Off 15
Sam Raw 1,Start(7),1000,8000 : Wait 2 : Sam Stop
Sam Raw 1,Start(7),100,8000
Print #1,Sam Swapped(0);Sam Swapped(4)
Track Play 6
Track Load "AMOSPRO:Examples/Music/Mod.Tracker",6 : Print #1,Length(6)>0;Leek(Start(6)-8)
Track Loop On : Wait Vbl : Track Play : Wait 50 : Print #1,"tr";Peek(M);Peek(M+1);Peek(M+2);Peek(M+3) : Track Stop : Track Loop Of
Med Play
Led On : Led Off
Print #1,"end"
Goto FIN
E: Print #1,"error";Errn : Resume Next
FIN:
